claimYield
├── caller lacks YIELDMANAGER_ROLE → revert
├── paused or emergency mode → revert
├── yield flow inactive → emit zero and retain shares
├── no unlocked yield or sub-USDC dust → emit zero and retain shares
├── unlocked yield rounds to zero shares → emit zero and retain shares
├── Yearn redemption returns zero or only sub-USDC-precision BOLD → revert atomically
├── Yearn liquidity, peg, oracle, or either swap check fails → revert atomically
└── unlocked yield exists → redeem only yield shares, swap to ETH, preserve principalValue, pay manager
